<title>UK: UBS set puts on the ten year Swiss franc swap rate.</title>
<headline>UBS set puts on the ten year Swiss franc swap rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS, Zurich said it has issued European-style put warrants, on the ten year Swiss franc swap rate.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3.50 PCT		  MAX PAYOUT   5.00 CHF</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.25 CHF		  LISTING	NONE</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	26.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	05.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REF	  3.71 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	     IF THE TEN YEAR SWISS SWAP RATE IS FIXED AT</p>
<p>		     OR BELOW 3.50 PCT ON EXPIRY DATE, THE WARRANT</p>
<p>		     PAYS OUT 5.00 CHF, OTHERWISE IT EXPIRES</p>
<p>		     WORTHLESS.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
